(1775, 1, '2026-09-24 08:40:04', '2026-09-24 08:40:04', '<h1>Toko Perlengkapan \nOlahraga Terlengkap</h1>				\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Belanja Sekarang\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"559\" height=\"366\" src=\"http://localhost/olahraga/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gambar-3.png\" alt=\"gambar 3\" />															\n															<img width=\"580\" height=\"367\" src=\"http://localhost/olahraga/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gambar-2.png\" alt=\"gambar 2\" />															\n					<h6>Tentang Sport Shop</h6>				\n				<h2 data-elementor-setting-key=\"infocard_title\" data-elementor-inline-editing-toolbar=\"basic\" >Pusat Perlengkapan Olahraga No 1</h2>			\n					<p>Dengan Mengutamakan Kenyaman dan daya tahan produk, kami memastikan setiap barang yang anda beli mampu mendongkrak performa fisik anda ke level maksimal. Jadikan keringat Anda lebih bermakna bersama koleksi andalan kami.</p>				\n		<p>Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia Curae; Donec velit neque, auctor sit amet aliquam vel, ullamcorper sit amet ligula. Quisque velit nisi, pretium ut lacinia in, elementum id enim. Vivamus suscipit tortor.</p>		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n										Produk 100% Original\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Lihat Koleksi\n					</a>\n									<h3>\n							15+						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Years In Business					</p>\n									<h3>\n							1.5k						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Happy Clients					</p>\n									<h3>\n							2.5k						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Projects Completed					</p>\n									<h3>\n							150+						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Trained Staff					</p>\n					<h6>Koleksi Kami</h6>				\n					<h2>Produk Olahraga Terbaru<br></h2>				\n		[downloads]		\n					<style>\n/* Perbaikan Grid Produk EDD Premium V2 */\n.edd_downloads_list {\n    display: grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)) !important;\n    gap: 30px !important;\n}\n.edd_download {\n    float: none !important;\n    width: 100% !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    background: #1a1a24;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    border: 1px solid #2d2d3d;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease; /* Animasi kotak */\n}\n.edd_download:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-8px); /* Kotak naik dikit saat disorot */\n}\n/* JUDUL DIBIKIN SELALU 2 BARIS (BIAR SEJAJAR) */\n.edd_download_title {\n    margin-top: 15px !important;\n    margin-bottom: 10px !important;\n    min-height: 52px; /* Paksa ruang 2 baris */\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n.edd_download_title a {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    font-size: 18px !important;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    display: -webkit-box;\n    -webkit-line-clamp: 2; /* Maksimal 2 baris */\n    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n/* POTONG TEKS 5 BARIS & RATA KIRI KANAN */\n.edd_download p, .edd_download_excerpt {\n    color: #d1d5db !important;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    text-align: justify !important;\n    display: -webkit-box;\n    -webkit-line-clamp: 5;\n    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}\n/* EFEK ZOOM GAMBAR */\n.edd_download_image {\n    overflow: hidden; /* Biar gambar gak keluar batas pas di-zoom */\n    border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.edd_download_image img {\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    width: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    aspect-ratio: 1/1;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    transition: transform 0.5s ease; /* Transisi zoom super mulus */\n}\n.edd_download:hover .edd_download_image img {\n    transform: scale(1.15); /* Zoom in 15% */\n}\n/* TOMBOL BELI */\n.edd_download_buy_button {\n    margin-top: auto;\n}\n.edd_download_buy_button .edd-add-to-cart {\n    background: #e63946 !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    border-radius: 30px !important;\n    padding: 12px 24px !important;\n    font-weight: bold !important;\n    border: none !important;\n    width: 100% !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    transition: 0.3s;\n}\n.edd_download_buy_button .edd-add-to-cart:hover {\n    background: #ff4d5a !important;\n    transform: scale(1.05); /* Tombol membesar dikit */\n}\n</style>\n					<h6>Kenapa Memilih Kami</h6>				\n					<h2>Keunggulan Portal Olahraga</h2>				\n									<h6>\n							Kualitas Premium						\n					</h6>\n									<p>\n						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. 					</p>\n									<h6>\n							100% Original						\n					</h6>\n									<p>\n						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. 					</p>\n									<h6>\n							Layanan Ahli						\n					</h6>\n									<p>\n						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. 					</p>\n									<h6>\n							Pengiriman Cepat						\n					</h6>\n									<p>\n						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. 					</p>\n									<h6>\n							Respon Kilat						\n					</h6>\n									<p>\n						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. 					</p>\n									<h6>\n							Garansi Resmi						\n					</h6>\n									<p>\n						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. 					</p>\n									<h5>\n							We Are Business Who Cares, And it Shows						\n					</h5>\n									<p>\n						OVER 540 “5 STARS” REVIEWS AND CLIMBING					</p>\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://localhost/olahraga/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/yelp.png\" alt=\"yelp\" /></figure><h6>Rate Us on Yelp</h6><p>248 reviews</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://localhost/olahraga/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/logo-google.png\" alt=\"logo google\" /></figure><h6>Rate Us on Google</h6><p>1,248 reviews</p>				\n									<h2>\n							People Say The Nicest Thin